      "description": "LBH Electric's entrepreneurial journey began in 2020. It is a technology company focusing on the design, development, manufacturing and sales of small personal care appliances with high-speed motor applications. We not only pursue the technological leadership of our products, but also pay more attention to design aesthetics and user experience, striving to make every product occupy a dominant position in the market. Since its establishment, LBH Electric has been leading the design trend and technological application innovation of personal care appliances, and is committed to creating the ultimate product experience - and will continue to do so in the future."
